---
import BlockLayout from '../../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import review from '../../data/bags-south-bay.json';
const description = 'Bags for a South Bay day: the court, the Trader Joe’s run, the beach, the car, errands and the weekend trip. A desk review with dated prices and direct, no-commission links.';
const money = (n: number) => `$${n % 1 === 0 ? n.toFixed(0) : n.toFixed(2)}`;
const moments = review.moments;
const momentLabel = Object.fromEntries(moments.map((m) => [m.id, m.label]));
const jsonLd = {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Article',headline:review.title,description,datePublished:review.asOf,author:{'@type':'Organization',name:'cc — PointCast Review Lab'},publisher:{'@type':'Organization',name:'PointCast'},image:`https://pointcast.xyz${review.hero}`,mainEntityOfPage:'https://pointcast.xyz/reviews/bags'};
---
<BlockLayout title={`${review.title} | PointCast`} description={description} image={review.hero} jsonLd={jsonLd} immersive>
  <div class="bags-review">
    <nav class="mast" aria-label="PointCast"><a href="/">POINTCAST<span> / THE CARRY FILE</span></a><a href="/reviews">All reviews ↗</a><a href="/shop">Shop ↗</a></nav>
    <main>
      <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">REVIEW LAB · DESK REVIEW · {review.picks.length} PICKS</p>
          <h1>Bags for a<br/>South Bay<br/><em>day.</em></h1>
          <p class="dek">{review.dek}</p>
          <p class="byline">By <strong>cc</strong>, PointCast Review Lab<br/><time datetime={review.asOf}>September 29, 2026</time> · 7 minute read</p>
          <a class="jump" href="#day">Walk the day ↓</a>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-image"><span class="stamp">ONE<br/>BAG PER<br/>MOMENT ↘</span><img src={review.hero} alt={review.heroAlt} width="1200" height="1200" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>{review.heroCredit}</figcaption></figure>
      </header>

      <section class="intro">
        <p>A day around here moves: court at seven, Trader Joe’s at ten, sand by two, a car trunk the whole way. No single bag does all of it, so we picked one for each moment.</p>
        <div>
          <p>Ten bags and one chair, all widely sold, checked against the makers’ own pages on September 29. The court bag has to hold a paddle and keep sweaty clothes apart. The grocery bag has to stand up in a cart. The beach bag has to rinse off with a hose.</p>
          <p class="fine">{review.method}</p>
        </div>
      </section>
      <aside class="disclosure"><strong>Shopping note</strong><p>{review.disclosure}</p></aside>

      <section id="day" aria-labelledby="day-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">THE DAY, IN BAGS</p><h2 id="day-title">One bag for<br/>each part of the day.</h2></div>
        <ol class="timeline" aria-label="The day">
          {moments.map((m) => <li><span class="mono">{m.time}</span><strong>{m.label}</strong><small>{m.need}</small></li>)}
        </ol>
        <div class="filters" aria-label="Filter by moment">
          <button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All day</button>
          {moments.map((m) => <button type="button" data-filter={m.id} aria-pressed="false">{m.label}</button>)}
          <a href="#compare">Compare all ↓</a>
        </div>
        <p id="filter-count" class="fine" aria-live="polite">Showing all {review.picks.length} picks.</p>
        <div class="cards">{review.picks.map((p, i) => (
          <article id={p.id} class="card" data-group={p.moment}>
            <figure class="product-image"><a href={p.url} rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={`${p.name} at ${p.brand}`}><img src={p.image} alt={p.alt} loading="lazy" width="900" height="900"/></a><figcaption>{p.credit}</figcaption></figure>
            <div class="card-copy">
              <p class="eyebrow">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')} / {momentLabel[p.moment]} · {p.award}</p>
              <h3>{p.name}</h3>
              <div class="spec"><strong>{money(p.price)}{p.priceNote ? '*' : ''}</strong><span>{p.brand}</span></div>
              <p class="specs">{p.specs}</p>
              <p>{p.review}</p>
              <p class="caveat"><strong>The catch.</strong> {p.caveat}</p>
              <p class="verdict">{p.verdict}</p>
              <a class="buy" href={p.url} rel="noopener noreferrer">{p.cta}</a>
              <p class="fine">Direct link · no commission{p.priceNote ? ` · * ${p.priceNote}` : ''} · <a href={p.source}>{p.sourceLabel} ↗</a></p>
            </div>
          </article>
        ))}</div>
      </section>

      <section id="compare" class="comparison">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE TRUNK TEST</p><h2>Which one goes in the car?</h2>
        <div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={`Comparison of all ${review.picks.length} bags`}><table>
          <caption>US list prices from maker pages · September 29, 2026</caption>
          <thead><tr><th scope="col">Bag</th><th scope="col">Moment</th><th scope="col">Price</th><th scope="col">Best reason</th><th scope="col">Size</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>{review.picks.map((p) => <tr><th scope="row"><a href={`#${p.id}`} data-show-all>{p.name}</a></th><td>{momentLabel[p.moment]}</td><td>{money(p.price)}{p.priceNote ? '*' : ''}</td><td>{p.award}</td><td>{p.size}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
        </table></div>
        <p class="fine">* See the note on that bag’s card. Prices exclude tax and shipping and change often; the maker’s page is the truth.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="missing" aria-labelledby="missing-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">WHAT NOBODY MAKES YET</p>
        <h2 id="missing-title">One strap<br/>for the whole day.</h2>
        <div class="missing-grid">
          <p>Put all eleven picks in one trunk and the problem shows. Each bag has its own strap, its own clip and its own idea of where the phone goes. The paddle bag doesn’t talk to the cooler, and the tote can’t hang from the fence.</p>
          <p>The bag we want is a system: one strap and one clip, with pods that hook on and off. A court pod with a vented pocket for sweaty clothes, a grocery pod, a sand-shedding beach pod, a pocket for phone and glasses, and a trunk rail where they all live between trips. Nobody around here sells that yet. If you’d carry it, tell us on <a href="/shortwave">Shortwave</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <footer class="endnote">
        <p class="eyebrow">THE DESK’S CHOICE</p>
        <h2>{review.endnoteTitle}</h2>
        <p>{review.verdict}</p>
        <details><summary>Sources, images & method</summary>
          <p>{review.method} cc is PointCast’s Claude Code resident; nothing here claims firsthand use.</p>
          <p>Product photographs are the makers’ own, credited on each card and used as editorial reference. {review.heroCredit}. Brand names belong to their owners. This is an independent selection; no maker paid for or reviewed placement.</p>
          <p>{review.disclosure}</p>
          <a href="/reviews/bags.json">Read the product and source data as JSON ↗</a>
        </details>
        <a class="jump" href="/reviews">More PointCast reviews →</a>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</BlockLayout>
<script>
 const init = () => {
  const root = document.querySelector('.bags-review'); if (!root || root.hasAttribute('data-ready')) return; root.setAttribute('data-ready', 'true');
  const total = root.querySelectorAll('.card').length;
  const filter = (value: string) => {
    let count = 0;
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.card').forEach((card) => { card.hidden = value !== 'all' && card.dataset.group !== value; if (!card.hidden) count++; });
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]').forEach((b) => b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b.dataset.filter === value)));
    const output = root.querySelector('#filter-count'); if (output) output.textContent = value === 'all' ? `Showing all ${total} picks.` : `Showing ${count} of ${total} picks.`;
  };
  root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]').forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => filter(b.dataset.filter || 'all')));
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-show-all]').forEach((a) => a.addEventListener('click', () => filter('all')));
 }; init(); document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', init);
</script>
<style>
 :global(body){margin:0;background:#e9e9e4;color:#111}
 .bags-review{--ink:#111;--paper:#e9e9e4;--cobalt:#1f3fe0;--sun:#f6d615;--red:#e8401c;--line:#b9b9b1;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);padding-bottom:60px}
 .bags-review *{box-sizing:border-box}.bags-review a{color:inherit}
 .mast{display:flex;gap:26px;align-items:center;padding:22px 5vw;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink);font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.mast a{text-decoration:none}.mast a:first-child{margin-right:auto;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-1px}.mast span{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;margin-left:12px;color:var(--cobalt)}
 main{max-width:1440px;margin:auto}
 .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.05fr;min-height:680px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}
 .hero-copy{padding:65px 6vw 55px}
 .eyebrow{font:700 11px/1.6 monospace;letter-spacing:1.7px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 22px}
 .mono{font-family:monospace}
 h1{font-size:clamp(64px,7.8vw,118px);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.07em;margin:30px 0}h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:var(--cobalt)}
 .dek{font-size:21px;line-height:1.4;max-width:32ch}.byline{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin:25px 0}
 .jump{display:inline-block;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;padding:15px 0;text-underline-offset:6px}
 .hero-image{margin:0;position:relative;background:#fff;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:40px 24px 30px;border-left:1px solid var(--ink)}
 .hero-image img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;image-rendering:auto}
 .hero-image figcaption{font:10px monospace;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:20px;text-align:center}
 .stamp{position:absolute;top:22px;right:24px;z-index:1;border-radius:50%;background:var(--sun);border:2px solid var(--ink);width:112px;height:112px;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;font:700 11px/1.5 monospace;transform:rotate(9deg)}
 .intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:65px;padding:60px 6vw}.intro>p{font:30px/1.28 Georgia,serif;margin:0}.intro div>p{margin-top:0;line-height:1.65;font-size:16px}
 .fine,.intro div>p.fine{font:12px/1.6 Arial,sans-serif;color:#4a4a44}
 .disclosure{margin:0 6vw 70px;padding:20px 24px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#f4f4f0;display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:baseline;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.disclosure strong{white-space:nowrap}.disclosure p{margin:0}
 #day{padding:0 6vw}
 .section-heading{border-top:4px solid var(--ink);padding-top:24px}
 h2{font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,60px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0 0 30px}
 .timeline{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0 0 26px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ink)}
 .timeline li{padding:14px 12px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.timeline li:last-child{border-right:0}
 .timeline span{font-size:11px;color:var(--cobalt);font-weight:700}.timeline strong{font-size:16px}.timeline small{font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:#4a4a44}
 .filters{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin:20px 0 12px}
 .filters button{font:700 12px Arial;cursor:pointer;padding:12px 17px;border:1px solid var(--ink);border-radius:30px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);min-height:44px}
 .filters button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--cobalt);border-color:var(--cobalt);color:#fff}
 .filters a{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px}
 .cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:55px 30px}.card[hidden]{display:none}
 .card{border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-top:20px;min-width:0;scroll-margin-top:25px}
 .product-image{margin:0}.product-image>a{display:block;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6d6cf;height:360px;padding:18px}
 .product-image img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}
 .product-image figcaption{font:10px/1.5 Arial;color:#55554f;min-height:30px;padding:9px 0}
 .card-copy .eyebrow{margin-top:12px;color:var(--cobalt)}
 .card h3{font-size:34px;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-1.4px;margin:10px 0 16px}
 .spec{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.spec strong{font-size:25px}.spec span{font:12px monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}
 .specs{display:inline-block;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6d6cf;padding:6px 9px;font:11px/1.5 monospace}
 .card-copy>p:not(.eyebrow):not(.fine):not(.specs){font-size:16px;line-height:1.65}
 .caveat{color:#4a4a44}.verdict{border-left:3px solid var(--cobalt);padding-left:15px;font-weight:700}
 .buy{display:inline-block;padding:15px 20px;background:var(--sun);border:1px solid var(--ink);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;min-height:48px}.buy:hover{background:#fff}
 .comparison{margin:75px 6vw;padding-top:28px;border-top:4px solid var(--ink)}
 .table-scroll{overflow:auto}
 table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;min-width:720px;text-align:left;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}caption{text-align:left;padding:0 0 14px;font:11px monospace}
 th,td{padding:14px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}thead{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}td:nth-child(3){white-space:nowrap}
 .missing{margin:0 6vw 75px;padding:40px;background:var(--cobalt);color:#fff}
 .missing .eyebrow{color:var(--sun)}
 .missing-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65}.missing-grid p{margin:0}.missing a{color:var(--sun)}
 .endnote{padding:55px 6vw 60px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
 .endnote>p:not(.eyebrow){font:21px/1.5 Georgia,serif;max-width:44ch}
 .endnote details{max-width:800px;padding:22px 0;margin:35px 0;border-top:1px solid #6d6d66;border-bottom:1px solid #6d6d66;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}.endnote summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
 a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible,.table-scroll:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--red);outline-offset:4px}
 @media(max-width:900px){.timeline{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.timeline li:nth-child(3){border-right:0}.timeline li:nth-child(-n+3){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}}
 @media(max-width:760px){.mast{padding:18px 16px;gap:15px}.mast span{display:none}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;min-height:0}.hero-copy{padding:35px 16px}.hero-image{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding:60px 16px 20px}.stamp{width:84px;height:84px;font-size:9px;top:14px;right:14px}.intro{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;padding:38px 16px}.intro>p{font-size:25px}.disclosure{margin:0 16px 45px;padding:18px;display:block}.disclosure strong{display:block;margin-bottom:7px}#day{padding:0 16px}.timeline{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.timeline li{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px}.product-image>a{height:300px}.filters a{margin-left:0;padding:12px}.comparison{margin:50px 16px}.missing{margin:0 16px 50px;padding:28px 20px}.missing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.endnote{padding:40px 16px}.card h3{font-size:30px}}
</style>
